WEBVTT

00:08:59.756 --> 00:09:01.556
The next area is People.

00:09:01.556 --> 00:09:04.716
People is about how you think
about your personal,

00:09:04.756 --> 00:09:07.356
mental and physical health.

00:09:07.396 --> 00:09:09.276
You have to start with yourself.

00:09:09.316 --> 00:09:13.196
You have to put your own oxygen mask on
before you can help others.

00:09:13.916 --> 00:09:17.556
This is also about how you impact
family, friends, society.

00:09:17.916 --> 00:09:19.556
It's about being human

00:09:19.596 --> 00:09:22.316
and having a positive impact on humanity.

00:09:22.876 --> 00:09:24.876
For this, I score myself a zero.

00:09:25.836 --> 00:09:27.196
Planet.

00:09:27.196 --> 00:09:29.876
Let's just say I took
over 100 flights last year,

00:09:29.916 --> 00:09:31.956
so I'm going to score myself a minus one.